      "end": 6.8,
      "text": "Elm Street, Friday. Rain from seven to ten this morning, we couldn't frame in that, the subfloor was too slick."
    },
    {
      "uploadId": "e0000014-0000-4000-8000-000000001401",
      "start": 6.8,
      "end": 12.5,
      "text": "So three hours lost on the framing. The crew waited it out and sorted material in the garage bays."
    },
    {
      "uploadId": "e0000014-0000-4000-8000-000000001401",
      "start": 12.5,
      "end": 20.4,
      "text": "Our crew, six guys, full day. After ten they framed second-floor walls on units one to four, about forty percent of the second floor."
    },
    {
      "uploadId": "e0000014-0000-4000-8000-000000001401",
      "start": 20.4,
      "end": 27,
      "text": "The lumber package for the second floor came at eleven thirty, two flatbeds from the yard."
    },
    {
      "uploadId": "e0000014-0000-4000-8000-000000001401",
      "start": 27,
      "end": 33,
      "text": "No incidents, toolbox talk on slips and wet surfaces. Two photos."
